	(text "Pin Functions (SLVSC40H 5): CP1-CP2 0.1 uF rated > VM; VCP 1 uF to VM;\nV5 0.1 uF; VINT 1 uF; VM 0.01 uF + bulk (sheet 2); BEMF 1 nF low leakage.\nSDATO, FAULTn, STALLn open drain: 10k pull-ups to +3V3.\nLogic VIH 1.5 V (6.5): the 3.3 V MCU drives it directly. BIN1/BIN2 unused\nin indexer mode: tied to GND. R306 holds SLEEPn low until the MCU drives it.\nBEMF to the ADC through 10k/20k: 5 V -> 3.33 V (derived);\nASSUMPTION: BEMF <= V5 and drives 30 kohm."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 217.17 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1494d2f7-eb8f-5e3e-86f5-045033476025")
	)
	(text "FET temperature"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 123.19 151.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "27cfe7d9-5bfc-53be-ad76-7a682fcf2855")
	)
	(text "ICHOP = 2.75 V x TORQUE / (256 x ISGAIN x RSENSE)\n(SLVSC40H eq. 1). ISGAIN 10, RSENSE 0.1 ohm,\nTORQUE 186: 2.00 A per phase (derived); TORQUE 255\ngives 2.74 A. Firmware limits TORQUE to 186 (HW-MOT-002).\nVSENSE 0.2 V at 2 A, under the 0.7 V xISENx rating.\nP = 0.2 W rms in a 1 W 2512.\nQ301-Q308: CSD18543Q3A, 60 V, Qg 11.1 nC (SLPS633).\nC306/C307: 4.7 uF at each bridge's high side."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 294.64 52.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "475aa9d5-eb6c-538e-ac5f-e67fe7555a56")
	)
	(text "RT301 sits between the bridges;\n10k NTC under a 10k pull-up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 161.29 0)
		(effects
